# System administration — spec section 19.

konsole
dolphin
gnome-disk-utility
htop
btop
plasma-systemmonitor
timeshift
p7zip-full
unzip
openssh-client
openssh-sftp-server
filezilla

# `journalctl` removed — it was never a real package name, it's the
# systemd journal command, provided by the `systemd` package that's
# already part of every Debian system regardless of this list. Listing
# it here was a mistake, not a naming variant to fix — apt correctly
# reported "Unable to locate package journalctl" because no such
# package has ever existed.
